        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Current commercial facilities.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes an estimation of the main material and energy use for the construction and the decommissioning of the facility. Land use, transport requirements, excavation for foundation, and disposal of inerts from decommissioning of the plant are also accounted for.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
